# Written by hand after the published format of Anthropic's Messages API:
# no real answer can be captured offline. Drafted by the reference parser,
# then checked by hand.
# The data of a content_block_delta event: a fragment of a tool's input, as JSON in a string.
object
key "type"
string "content_block_delta"
key "index"
number 1
key "delta"
object
key "type"
string "input_json_delta"
key "partial_json"
string "{\"path\": \"src/ma"
end object
end object
done
